l Tire finding the leak\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Well here it is Friday morning and we just woke up and are ready to head out of Missouri and on into Kansas for Friday night. If you&#8217;ve been following along, you know we&#8217;ve had some tire problems along the way. \u00a0When we left home Tuesday morning, two of our new tires had lost significant &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/09\/12\/we-finally-made-it-out-of-ohio\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">We FINALLY made it out of Ohio!<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[18285],"tags":[17834,537575],"class_list":["post-1588","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-equipment","tag-beads","tag-tires"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1588","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1588"}],"version-history":[{"count":17,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1588\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1639,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1588\/revisions\/1639"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1588"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1588"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=158